      "headline": "Image safety classification across sexually explicit, dangerous, and violent content",
      "source": {
        "page": "Model Information",
        "quote": "ShieldGemma 2 is a model trained on Gemma 3's 4B IT checkpoint for image safety classification across key categories that takes in images and outputs safety labels per policy."
      }
